      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 self.zero_pad(x)，padding 为 (left, right, top, bottom) = (1,1,1,1)。",
        "在输入张量的 H,W 维度两侧填充零，不改变 batch 和 channel 维度。",
        "输出尺寸 = (H+top+bottom, W+left+right) = (34+2, 34+2) = (36,36)。",
        "返回新张量，输入不被原地修改。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "log_softmax_channel_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[512, 3, 36, 36]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "dim",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false,
          "default": null
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[512, 3, 36, 36]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 self.log_softmax(x)，dim=1。",
        "对每个 (batch, height, width) 位置沿 channel 轴计算 log_softmax：y_i = x_i - max_c(x_c) - log(sum_c exp(x_c - max_c(x_c)))。",
        "使用 max 减法保证数值稳定性，输入输出形状相同。",
        "输出 dtype 保持 torch.float32。"
      ]
    },
    {
